n\"><button data-testid=\"nav-products\">PRODUCTS <span>⌄</span></button><button data-testid=\"nav-solutions\">SOLUTIONS <span>⌄</span></button><a data-testid=\"nav-lumimorph\" href=\"/lumimorph\">LUMIMORPH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-naturatex\" href=\"/naturatex\">NATURATEX</a><a data-testid=\"nav-signatouch\" href=\"/signatouch\">SIGNATOUCH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-glassmorph\" href=\"/glassmorph\">GLASSMORPH</a><button data-testid=\"nav-more-btn\">☰ <span>⌄</span></button></nav><button class=\"mobile-menu-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" data-testid=\"mobile-menu-toggle\">☰</button></div></header><main data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\"\", \"description\": \"The Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\" is a premium 4K UHD seamless LED display designed as a direct drop-in replacement for traditional projectors. Featuring a 1.5mm pixel pitch and 600 nits brightness, it delivers crystal-clear visuals with vibrant colors and no shadows. Built-in 40W audio complements video conferencing needs, creating a complete, plug-and-play meeting room solution perfect for boardrooms, training rooms, and executive spaces.\", \"sku\": \"BL-RDY-MTG136\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/meeting-room-led-136\", \"category\": \"ready-made\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_meeting-room-led-136.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 2000, \"highPrice\": 15000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/meeting-room-led-136\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"600 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What makes the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\" a better choice over traditional projectors?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This LED display offers a bright 600-nit panel with 4K UHD resolution, providing vibrant, clear visuals without shadows or glare, unlike projectors. Its seamless, large 136\\\" screen combined with built-in audio ensures a complete, high-quality meeting room experience.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\" is designed as a plug-and-play solution with a drop-in replacement setup. It requires standard electrical power and minimal mounting space, simplifying installation compared to complex projector systems.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are provided with this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"We offer a comprehensive warranty covering parts and labor for up to 3 years. Our technical support team is available for installation guidance, maintenance, and troubleshooting to ensure uninterrupted performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this LED display support video conferencing systems?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the display integrates built-in 40W audio and is compatible with most conferencing devices, providing clear visuals and audio for meetings without requiring additional sound systems.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the 1.5mm pixel pitch affect image quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 1.5mm pixel pitch ensures extremely fine pixel density, delivering razor-sharp images and text that are easily viewable even at close range, which is ideal for detailed presentations and video content.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this product energy-efficient compared to other display solutions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, LED technology is inherently more energy-efficient than traditional projectors, consuming less power while providing superior brightness and image quality, reducing operational costs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the expected pricing framework for this all-in-one unit?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pricing varies based on installation complexity and optional add-ons, but as a premium ready-made solution, it provides competitive value compared to assembling separate components like projector, screen, and audio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\" be customized for different room sizes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This model is optimized for 136-inch meeting rooms as a turnkey solution. For other sizes or configurations, custom options are available but would require consultation.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\"\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/meeting-room-led-136\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136&quot;</h1><p>Enhance meetings with our 136&quot; All-in-One LED display in Dubai. Buy now for superior visuals in UAE corporate spaces.</p><p><strong>Drop-in replacement for projectors. 136&quot; 4K LED. Plug and play.</strong></p><p>The Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136&quot; is a premium 4K UHD seamless LED display designed as a direct drop-in replacement for traditional projectors. Featuring a 1.5mm pixel pitch and 600 nits brightness, it delivers crystal-clear visuals with vibrant colors and no shadows. Built-in 40W audio complements video conferencing needs, creating a complete, plug-and-play meeting room solution perfect for boardrooms, training rooms, and executive spaces.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136&quot; a better choice over traditional projectors?</h3><p>This LED display offers a bright 600-nit panel with 4K UHD resolution, providing vibrant, clear visuals without shadows or glare, unlike projectors. Its seamless, large 136&quot; screen combined with built-in audio ensures a complete, high-quality meeting room experience.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements for this LED display?</h3><p>The Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136&quot; is designed as a plug-and-play solution with a drop-in replacement setup. It requires standard electrical power and minimal mounting space, simplifying installation compared to complex projector systems.</p><h3>What warranty and support options are provided with this product?</h3><p>We offer a comprehensive warranty covering parts and labor for up to 3 years. Our technical support team is available for installation guidance, maintenance, and troubleshooting to ensure uninterrupted performance.</p><h3>Can this LED display support video conferencing systems?</h3><p>Yes, the display integrates built-in 40W audio and is compatible with most conferencing devices, providing clear visuals and audio for meetings without requiring additional sound systems.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"site-footer\" data-testid=\"footer\"><div class=\"site-footer__inner\"><section class=\"site-footer__brand\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><p>Premium LED display solutions for UAE and MENA. Established since 2005.</p><div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" data-testid=\"footer-social-instagram\">◎</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" data-testid=\"footer-social-linkedin\">in</a></div></section><section><h2>EXPLORE</h2><a href=\"/products\">PRODUCTS</a><a href=\"/solutions\">SOLUTIONS</a><a href=\"/technology\">TECHNOLOGY</a><a href=\"/case-studies\">CASE STUDIES</a><a href=\"/blog\">BLOG</a></section><section><h2>LOCATIONS</h2><a href=\"/dubai\">DUBAI</a><a href=\"/abu-dhabi\">ABU DHABI</a><a href=\"/saudi-arabia\">SAUDI ARABIA</a><a href=\"/qatar\">QATAR</a><a href=\"/kuwait\">KUWAIT</a><a href=\"/bahrain\">BAHRAIN</a><a href=\"/oman\">OMAN</a></section><section><h2>COMPANY</h2><a href=\"/about\">ABOUT US</a><a href=\"/contact\">CONTACT US</a><a href=\"/factory-tour\">FACTORY TOUR</a><a href=\"/faq\">FAQ</a><a href=\"/resources\">RESOURCES</a></section><section><h2>CONTACT</h2><a href=\"https://maps.google.com/?q=Jebel+Ali+Industrial+Area+1+Dubai\" data-testid=\"footer-map-link\">Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1, Dubai, UAE</a><a href=\"tel:+97142585754\" data-testid=\"footer-phone-link\">+971 4 258 5754</a><a href=\"mailto:sales@brightluxx.com\" data-testid=\"footer-email-link\">sales@brightluxx.com</a></section></div><div class=\"site-footer__bottom\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> BRIGHTLUXX. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.<span>A DIVISION OF IHG INDUSTRY L.L.C</span></div></footer><a class=\"floating-whatsapp\" href=\"https://wa.me/971559954274\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-testid=\"global-whatsapp-link\" aria-label=\"WhatsApp\">◔</a><a class=\"floating-phone\" href=\"tel:+97142585754\" d