nstallation requirements for this LED display?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"The Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\\\\\" is designed as a plug-and-play solution with a drop-in replacement setup. It requires standard electrical power and minimal mounting space, simplifying installation compared to complex projector systems.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What warranty and support options are provided with this product?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"We offer a comprehensive warranty covering parts and labor for up to 3 years. Our technical support team is available for installation guidance, maintenance, and troubleshooting to ensure uninterrupted performance.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Can this LED display support video conferencing systems?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Yes, the display integrates built-in 40W audio and is compatible with most conferencing devices, providing clear visuals and audio for meetings without requiring additional sound systems.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How does the 1.5mm pixel pitch affect image quality?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"A 1.5mm pixel pitch ensures extremely fine pixel density, delivering razor-sharp images and text that are easily viewable even at close range, which is ideal for detailed presentations and video content.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Is this product energy-efficient compared to other display solutions?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Yes, LED technology is inherently more energy-efficient than traditional projectors, consuming less power while providing superior brightness and image quality, reducing operational costs.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What is the expected pricing framework for this all-in-one unit?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Pricing varies based on installation complexity and optional add-ons, but as a premium ready-made solution, it provides competitive value compared to assembling separate components like projector, screen, and audio.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Can the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\\\\\" be customized for different room sizes?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"This model is optimized for 136-inch meeting rooms as a turnkey solution. For other sizes or configurations, custom options are available but would require consultation.\\\"}}]}9:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"main\\\",null,{\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$13\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$14\\\"}}],\\\"$L15\\\",\\\"$L16\\\",\\\"$L17\\\"],\\\"$L18\\\"]}]\\n15:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 1, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\"}, {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 2, \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Products\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\\\\\"}, {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\": 3, \\\\\\\"n