\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n19:T7ce,\\u003ch1\\u003eMeeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\u0026quot;\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eEnhance meetings with our 136\\u0026quot; All-in-One LED display in Dubai. Buy now for superior visuals in UAE corporate spaces.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDrop-in replacement for projectors. 136\\u0026quot; 4K LED. Plug and play.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\u0026quot; is a premium 4K UHD seamless LED display designed as a direct drop-in replacement for traditional projectors. Featuring a 1.5mm pixel pitch and 600 nits brightness, it delivers crystal-clear visuals with vibrant colors and no shadows. Built-in 40W audio complements video conferencing needs, creating a complete, plug-and-play meeting room solution perfect for boardrooms, training rooms, and executive spaces.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat makes the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\u0026quot; a better choice over traditional projectors?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis LED display offers a bright 600-nit panel with 4K UHD resolution, providing vibrant, clear visuals without shadows or glare, unlike projectors. Its seamless, large 136\\u0026quot; screen combined with built-in audio ensures a complete, high-quality meeting room experience.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat are the installation requirements for this LED display?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\u0026quot; is designed as a plug-and-play solution with a drop-in replacement setup. It requires standard electrical power and minimal mounting space, simplifying installation compared to complex projector systems.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat warranty and support options are provided with this product?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe offer a comprehensive warranty covering parts and labor for up to 3 years. Our technical support team is available for installation guidance, maintenance, and troubleshooting to ensure uninterrupted performance.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eCan this LED display support video conferencing systems?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, the display integrates built-in 40W audio and is compatible with most conferencing devices, providing clear visuals and audio for meetings without requiring additional sound systems.\\u003c/p\\u003e18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$19\\\"}}]\\nf:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\nc:null\\n11:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"chil