mprehensive warranty covering parts and labor for up to 3 years. Our technical support team is available for installation guidance, maintenance, and troubleshooting to ensure uninterrupted performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this LED display support video conferencing systems?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the display integrates built-in 40W audio and is compatible with most conferencing devices, providing clear visuals and audio for meetings without requiring additional sound systems.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the 1.5mm pixel pitch affect image quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 1.5mm pixel pitch ensures extremely fine pixel density, delivering razor-sharp images and text that are easily viewable even at close range, which is ideal for detailed presentations and video content.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this product energy-efficient compared to other display solutions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, LED technology is inherently more energy-efficient than traditional projectors, consuming less power while providing superior brightness and image quality, reducing operational costs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the expected pricing framework for this all-in-one unit?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pricing varies based on installation complexity and optional add-ons, but as a premium ready-made solution, it provides competitive value compared to assembling separate components like projector, screen, and audio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the Meeting Room LED All-in-One 136\\\" be customized for different room sizes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This model is optimized for 136-inch meeting rooms as a turnkey solution. For other sizes or configurations, custom options are available but would require consul